# Copy to server/.env (git-ignored) for local runs; on Render set these in the dashboard.
# All optional. See docs/VOICE.md.

# Cloudflare TURN (Realtime > TURN Server > Create key): the key's ID and API token.
CLOUDFLARE_TURN_KEY_ID=
CLOUDFLARE_TURN_API_TOKEN=

# Or a self-hosted TURN server (coturn), used when Cloudflare isn't set. coturn must run
# with use-auth-secret and static-auth-secret=<the same value as TURN_SECRET>; each player
# gets a credential that expires after a day. (A fixed username/password isn't supported:
# it would be handed to everyone who joins a room.)
# TURN_URLS=turn:turn.example.com:3478?transport=udp,turns:turn.example.com:5349?transport=tcp
# TURN_SECRET=
